# Frontend

- React function components + TypeScript. No `any`.
- Vite only. Do not add Next.js, Redux, or a CSS framework unless asked.
- Chat messages render `answer` plus citation cards: filename, page, excerpt.
- Show a visible “low confidence” state when `confidence === "low"`.
- API types live in `frontend/src/types.ts` and must match FastAPI schemas.
- Keep secrets off the client. Only `VITE_API_URL` (and optional public API key header later).
